vkd3d: match unused color targets for colorless KosmicKrisp pipelines

Metal validation caught an Invalid pipeline color format bound to an R8Unorm
framebuffer in ReSkate. For colorless pipelines on KosmicKrisp without unused
attachment support, track the bound color formats and reuse cached variants
that match them, keeping color writes disabled. Preserve rendering attachments,
clears, stores and resolves. Only colorless pipelines retain their shader code
for these variants; ordinary color pipelines retain the existing memory use.
Other drivers and drivers with the extension keep the existing path.

